Users/Kartik%20Bhosle/.gemini/antigravity/brain/6976d1a8-fd03-4453-a790-acd552e1861a/cpp-backend/build.bat) & [`run.bat`](file:///C:/Users/Kartik%20Bhosle/.gemini/antigravity/brain/6976d1a8-fd03-4453-a790-acd552e1861a/cpp-backend/run.bat)\n  - Integration Tests: [`test_api.ps1`](file:///C:/Users/Kartik%20Bhosle/.gemini/antigravity/brain/6976d1a8-fd03-4453-a790-acd552e1861a/cpp-backend/test_api.ps1) & [`test_api.sh`](file:///C:/Users/Kartik%20Bhosle/.gemini/antigravity/brain/6976d1a8-fd03-4453-a790-acd552e1861a/cpp-backend/test_api.sh)\n  - Documentation: [`README.md`](file:///C:/Users/Kartik%20Bhosle/.gemini/antigravity/brain/6976d1a8-fd03-4453-a790-acd552e1861a/cpp-backend/README.md)\n\n---\n\n### 🚀 Running the Platform\n\n1. **Launch C++ Backend Server:**\n   ```cmd\n   cd cpp-backend\n   build.bat\n   run.bat\n   ```\n   *The server starts on `http://localhost:8080`.*\n\n2. **Run Automated Test Suite:**\n   ```powershell\n   cd cpp-backend\n   .\\test_api.ps1\n   ```\n\n3. **Open Front-End Interface:**\n   - Double-click [`index.html`](file:///C:/Users/Kartik%20Bhosle/.gemini/antigravity/brain/6976d1a8-fd03-4453-a790-acd552e1861a/index.html) in any modern browser.\n\nAll files are preserved and ready for deployment."}
{"step_index":142,"source":"USER_EXPLICIT","type":"USER_INPUT","status":"DONE","created_at":"2026-10-20T06:15:33Z","content":"<USER_REQUEST>\n# TASK: Complete Code Audit, Bug Fix, and Cleanup for NexusMobility\r\n\r\n## Objective\r\nPerform a thorough code review and debugging audit across all repository files (`index.html`, `app.js`, `styles.css`, and associated project files) for the **NexusMobility** application. Identify edge cases, runtime bugs, state sync issues, memory/rendering leaks, and performance bottlenecks, and fix them cleanly without breaking existing styling or features.\r\n\r\n---\r\n\r\n## 🔍 Audit & Debugging Checklist\r\n\r\n### 1. State Engine & Logic Validation (`app.js`)\r\n- **Dijkstra & Pathfinding**:\r\n  - Verify edge cases where origin and destination are disconnected or identical.\r\n  - Fix any potential infinite loop or array mutation bugs during path lookup.\r\n- **Standby Lounge Circular Queue**:\r\n  - Verify boundary conditions for `standbyCount == 5` (full capacity) and `standbyCount == 0` (empty queue).\r\n  - Check pointer wrapping logic (`front` and `rear` indexing) to ensure no array out-of-bounds errors or stale state.\r\n- **Trip Dispatch & Cancellation**:\r\n  - Ensure driver seat counts cannot drop below zero (`seats < 0`).\r\n  - Verify that canceling or reverting a trip accurately restores seat capacity without exceeding `originalSeats`.\r\n  - Fix any reference decoupling bugs when modifying `passenger` object statuses in `dispatchStream` vs `activeTrips`.\r\n\r\n### 2. Canvas & Rendering Diagnostics (`Urban3DCanvas` & `AmbientEcoCanvas`)\r\n- **Animation Loop & Memory Leaks**:\r\n  - Verify `requestAnimationFrame` cancellation/cleanup on canvas re-initialization or tab switching.\r\n  - Ensure mouse movement and zoom event listeners do not throw runtime errors when elements are off-screen.\r\n- **3D Projection Matrix & Bounds**:\r\n  - Fix edge cases where zooming out (`scale`) or rotation (`rotX`, `rotY`) causes coordinate clipping or `NaN` canvas drawing calls.\r\n  - Verify heading angle calculations (`Math.atan2`) for vehicle navigation along route vectors.\r\n\r\n### 3. DOM & Event Handling (`index.html` & `app.js`)\r\n- **Null Reference Guarding**:\r\n  - Add optional chaining / null checks for all `document.getElementById` and `querySelector` calls to prevent script crashes if an element is missing.\r\n- **Form Input Sanitization**:\r\n  - Trim user input and prevent empty or duplicate passenger/driver names from breaking UI layouts.\r\n- **Modal State Sync**:\r\n  - Ensure backdrop clicks and `ESC` key events cleanly close active modals (`#dispatch-confirm-modal`, `#reversal-confirm-modal`, `#receipt-modal-overlay`).\r\n\r\n### 4. CSS & Layout Polish (`styles.css`)\r\n- Fix any broken CSS flexbox/grid responsive layouts on mobile or small viewports.\r\n- Check z-index stacking context between the background `#ambient-canvas`, 3D map canvas, glassmorphism cards, and enterprise modal overlays.\r\n\r\n---\r\n\r\n## 📦 Required Output Format\r\n\r\n1. **Bug Report & Summary**: List all identified issues, categorized by severity (Critical, Major, Minor/Code Quality).\r\n2. **Corrected Codebase Files**: Provide the complete, bug-fixed versions of `app.js`, `index.html`, or `styles.css` with inline code comments explaining every fix made.\r\n3. **Verification Steps**: Outline simple test steps to confirm that all bugs have been resolved.\n</USER_REQUEST>\n<ADDITIONAL_METADATA>\nThe current local time is: 2026-10-20T11:45:33+05:30.\n</ADDITIONAL_METADATA>"}
